-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Tăng cường hệ miễn dịch cho cây:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt; Phân bón hữu cơ giúp tăng cường hệ miễn dịch cho cây, giúp cây chống lại các loại sâu bệnh hiệu quả hơn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ol start=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Những Lợi Ích Của Phân Bón Hữu Cơ Đối Với Cây Trồng Và Môi Trường Là Gì?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Nhữ