s:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Dưới đây là một số những lợi ích mà chúng ta sẽ nhận được khi trồng hữu cơ tại nhà:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Sức khỏe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Sản phẩm hữu cơ không chứa hóa chất tổng hợp, an toàn hơn cho sức khỏe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Môi trường&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Giảm thiểu ô nhiễm đất và nước do hóa chất.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Kinh tế&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Tiết kiệm chi phí mua phân bón và thuốc trừ sâu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Giáo dục&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Học hỏi về tự nhiên và phát triển kỹ năng trồng trọt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ol start=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;h1 role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38; font-size:20pt; font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; color:#000000; font-weight:700; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; white-space:pre; padding-inline-start:48px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chuẩn bị trước khi trồng trọt hữu cơ tại nhà&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Những điều mà người trồng phải chuẩn bị khi bắt đầu trồng trọt hữu cơ tại nhà:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;3.1. Lựa vị trí&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chọn vị trí có đủ ánh sáng mặt trời, ít nhất 6-8 giờ mỗi ngày. Đảm bảo vị trí thoáng gió và dễ tiếp cận nước tưới.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;3.2. Chọn dụng cụ và vật liệu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chuẩn bị các dụng cụ như xẻng, cuốc, bình tưới, và găng tay. Sử dụng chậu, thùng xốp hoặc khu vườn nhỏ để trồng cây. Đảm bảo vật liệu có chất lượng tốt và không chứa chất độc hại.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;3.4. Chọn giống cây trồng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chọn giống cây phù hợp với điều kiện khí hậu và đất đai của khu vực. Ưu tiên các giống cây hữu cơ và kháng bệnh tốt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ol start=&quot;4&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;h1 role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38; font-size:20pt; font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; color:#000000; font-weight:700; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; white-space:pre; padding-inline-start:48px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Các bước trồng trọt hữu cơ tại nhà&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Nếu các bạn chưa biết cách để trồng trọt hữu cơ tại nhà thì dưới đây chính là các bước cụ thể mà các bạn có thể tham khảo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;4.1. Chuẩn bị đất&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Sử dụng phân hữu cơ như phân trùn quế, phân bò, hoặc phân gà để cải thiện chất lượng đất. Trộn đất với phân hữu cơ và các loại chất cải tạo đất như xơ dừa, mùn cưa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;4.2. Gieo hạt và trồng cây&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Sử dụng phân hữu cơ như phân trùn quế, phân bò, hoặc phân gà để cải thiện chất lượng đất. Trộn đất với phân hữu cơ và các loại chất cải tạo đất như xơ dừa, mùn cưa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;4.3. Chăm sóc cây trồng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Tưới nước đều đặn, không để đất khô cằn nhưng cũng không để ngập úng. Bổ sung phân hữu cơ định kỳ để cung cấp dinh dưỡng cho cây.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;4.4. Kiểm soát sâu bệnh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Sử dụng các biện pháp sinh học như cây trồng xen kẽ, bẫy côn trùng, và chế phẩm sinh học để kiểm soát sâu bệnh. Tránh sử dụng thuốc trừ sâu hóa học.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ol start=&quot;5&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;h1 role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; font-size:20pt; font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; color:#000000; font-weight:700; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; white-space:pre; padding-inline-start:48px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Mẹo trồng trọt hữu cơ tại nhà&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chúng tôi sẽ mách bạn một số mẹo để trồng trọt hữu cơ tại nhà đạt hiệu quả cao nhé!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Luân canh cây trồng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Thay đổi vị trí cây trồng mỗi mùa để tránh sâu bệnh và bảo vệ đất.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Sử dụng chế phẩm tự nhiên&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Dùng nước ngâm tỏi, ớt, gừng để phun lên cây nhằm phòng trừ sâu bệnh.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Tạo môi trường sinh thái&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Trồng các loại cây hoa để thu hút côn trùng có lợi như ong và bướm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ol start=&quot;6&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;h1 role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38; font-size:20pt; font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; color:#000000; font-weight:700; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; text-decoration:none; vertical-align:baseline; white-space:pre; padding-inline-start:48px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Những lưu ý khi trồng trọt hữu cơ tại nhà&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n	&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aria