-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Kiên nhẫn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;: Trồng trọt hữu cơ yêu cầu sự kiên nhẫn và chăm chỉ. Cây trồng phát triển tự nhiên sẽ mất thời gian hơn so với việc sử dụng hóa chất.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-position:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Theo dõi thường xuyên&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14pt; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-va